contracts/evm/out/
contracts/evm/cache/
contracts/evm/broadcast/

# Dependencies are vendored under contracts/evm/lib/ deliberately: CREATE2 parity depends
# on byte-identical initcode, so the exact dependency bytes are load-bearing rather than a
# convenience. See docs/todo.md if converting them to submodules.

